reading: if beta=0 PSD and beta>0 develops NEGATIVE eigenvalues (like F_q §401), the number-field
Rosati form IS the certificate and off-line zeros break its PSD-ness DIRECTLY (Weil positivity in
zero coordinates, not prime coordinates). This is well-posed (unlike §378: we move zeros in the ZERO
form, not the prime form). The gap to a PROOF = why must this specific form be PSD (=the Hodge index).
